{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "60b258c1-2fc0-8390-bf12-1f0eaa4d94f1",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T11:30:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Barbara Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:28:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:28:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin. I've got an old appliance I need to get rid of. A dryer, to be specific. It's been in the garage longer than I'd like to admit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:28:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a dryer. Sure, we can sort that out. Is this for curbside pickup at your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:28:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the hope. I'm at 327 Washington Street, in the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:28:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three twenty-seven Washington. Got it. Let me write that down. Dryer, curbside, Washington Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:29:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. And I should say, I'm writing down everything you tell me. Last time I called somewhere I trusted my memory and that went badly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:29:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good policy. Go ahead, I'll go slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:29:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Appreciate it. So can the dryer just go out with the regular trash, or is it something separate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:29:21-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Big appliances like that usually aren't picked up with the regular trash. They're handled as a bulky item, so you'd schedule it with us. If it's got a door, that sometimes has to come off or be secured, so just have it ready at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:29:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Door off or secured. Okay. Anything else I should do to it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:29:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Make sure it's empty, unplugged, and the cord is tucked in. Put it out the night before, or early that morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:29:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Night before, empty, cord tucked. Got it. And when's the next pickup for my street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:29:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull it up. Washington Street in the Point... your regular trash day is Monday, so the next one is this coming Monday. Recycling goes out on the alternate week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:30:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday. So would the dryer go out that same day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd put it in as a bulky request for that Monday. I'm entering it now, dryer at 327 Washington. Is there a good number if the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0155."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:30:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one five five. Perfect, you're all set. Just have it out by Monday morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday morning, curb, door secured. That's everything I have. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:30:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:30:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
